Note: Estimates and interval bounds are in logits. SE = standard error; SD = standard deviation; RealSE = ModelSE *
sqrt(max(Infit, 1)). Displayed general-table SEs and intervals are exploratory (Use = screening_only;
SupportsFormalInference = FALSE). Infit and Outfit are mean-square fit statistics (MnSq), with model expectation 1.
Underfit (>1) means more unexplained variation than expected; overfit (<1) means less. These are not ability or
rater-quality scores. The review flags use separate thresholds; do not exclude a person or rater on this statistic
alone. These are not automatic pass/fail judgments. Conditional: other fitted parameters are held fixed; exploratory
normal bands are screening_only (SupportsFormalInference=FALSE). Method details and source values are retained in this
project.

